# The API's address for `bun run dev:ui` — the UI on its own, with no launcher to tell it where
# the server is. `bun run dev:server` defaults to this same port, so the two halves agree.
#
# `bun run dev` overrides this: it picks a free port per run and passes it as NEXT_PUBLIC_PERCH_URL,
# and a real environment variable wins over this file.
#
# Only `next dev` reads it. `next build` — the static export the server ships — reads
# .env.production, where this is deliberately unset: there the API is same-origin.
NEXT_PUBLIC_PERCH_URL=http://127.0.0.1:4600
